// EDITION: rust
// RULE: D6.2.2
// (0.27.2) `&N` of a const returned as `&'static i64`: no rvalue static
// promotion, the reference is to a local temporary (L2).
// RUSTC: accepts L2 rustc promotes the constant to a static
// ERROR: error[borrowck.return_local]
